# counter harness. One force call is one minhocao POSDATA evaluated by lennard_jones.
# Positions cross the socket in Bohr and return as Hartree and Ha/Bohr with FLAME Bohr_Ang and Ha_eV.
# The cluster is translated to the centre of a 1e7 Angstrom cell. The potential has no periodic images.
# ioput is the documented minhocao start 1.d-2 5.d2 1.d5. earr tolerances are 2.d-3 1.d-1.
# Local optimisation is the code default FIRE tolerance 2.d-4 Ha/Bohr.
# Success is a relaxed enthalpy at or below -173.927427, the reference plus energy_above_minimum. The count stops before the next hop is charged.
# Default minhocao. The local optimiser, softening, molecular-dynamics length, and FIRE tolerance are the params_new defaults (FIRE, GEOTOLMXF 2.d-4 Ha/Bohr, SOFTNIT 10, MDNIT 300, dtion_md 20). ioput is the documented start 1.d-2 5.d2 1.d5 and the earr tolerances are 2.d-3 1.d-1. The seed is 314159. Free boundaries select the Gaussian molecular fingerprint. VERBOSE is 0 so a geometry file is not written on every force call; global.mon still records every hop. The reference energy is the Cambridge LJ38 minimum -173.928427; success is that value plus the problem tolerance 0.001, which is the 2014 eOn stop -173.927427. failure_cap is the 2014 eOn basin-hopping step budget and is a safety stop. The potential is the harness Lennard-Jones kernel through msock.
